WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.566
What if your assistant could run the other AI tools for you?

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.762
I ask Cunning Claw for a job book app, for an electrician.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.311
It writes the brief for Lovable, and nothing goes until I say so.

4
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.609
Lovable builds it, and the claw brings back the links.

5
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.874
Five pages, for just over five credits.

6
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.329
Lovable puts the code on GitHub.

7
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.311
Now a change, straight in GitHub: our phone number in the menu.

8
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.188
One card, with the exact commit. I approve it.

9
00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:14.051
And Lovable picks it up on its own.

10
00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:22.951
It looked a bit plain, so: a proper front page, with a quote form.

11
00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:37.227
Lovable builds the website, while the claw keeps watch.

12
00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.951
Publish? That's a card too.

13
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.967
And it's live.

14
00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:10.531
A working website, clearly marked as a demo.

15
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.751
A customer asks for a quote…

16
00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:27.529
and it lands straight in the job book.

17
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:39.446
Cunning Claw. It runs your tools, and asks before every step. Free, at cunningclaw.com.
